\ Dogfood: Phase 4 Slice 5a (R24). The type half of a small two-file library:
\ a 2D point, exported so `examples/modules_ops.sth` and `examples/modules.sth`
\ can both name it by qualified reference (`point::Point`) across a file
\ boundary, the same struct `examples/vectors.sth` uses single-file.

import: intrinsics * ;

type: Point x i64 y i64 ;

export: Point ;
